WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.300 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 32]

02:06.790 --> 02:08.220
You were hit by countless blow of my blade qi

02:08.520 --> 02:10.130
in order to protect that lass.

02:10.800 --> 02:12.450
You've sustained serious internal injuries.

02:13.240 --> 02:15.260
If you utilize your arts within the next 15 minutes,

02:16.080 --> 02:17.290
I don't even need to kill you.

02:18.150 --> 02:20.340
You'll die from the severance of your nerves and meridians.

02:26.190 --> 02:26.850
Mr. Su.

02:27.630 --> 02:28.380
Second Master Tu.

02:28.750 --> 02:29.380
Mr. Su,

02:29.960 --> 02:31.100
stop calling me that.

02:31.800 --> 02:32.660
You may call me Tu Wan.

02:33.240 --> 02:34.450
You and I are friends.

02:38.080 --> 02:39.100
Use this time to regulate your breathing.

02:39.710 --> 02:41.060
I'll buy you some time.

02:56.030 --> 02:57.200
15 minutes, huh?

03:00.630 --> 03:01.500
I wish to give it a try.

03:03.000 --> 03:04.240
Do you wish to save him?

03:04.680 --> 03:05.290
Yes, I do.

03:06.280 --> 03:07.130
I want to save him.

03:08.120 --> 03:09.260
You think you can save him?

03:10.560 --> 03:11.730
Judging from your cultivation stage,

03:12.190 --> 03:13.780
I suppose you haven't reached the Vajra Mortal-Stage yet.

03:15.470 --> 03:16.660
It seems I'm being belittled.

03:26.710 --> 03:28.500
Since you can corner Mr. Su to this extent,

03:28.960 --> 03:30.410
I suppose you're running out of strength as well.

03:30.710 --> 03:31.660
Perhaps the current you

03:32.360 --> 03:34.010
is weaker than a Vajra Mortal-Stage cultivator!

03:35.430 --> 03:36.610
Since you have a death wish,

03:38.750 --> 03:40.500
I shall grant your wish.

03:45.240 --> 03:45.820
Stop!

03:51.680 --> 03:53.080
Now, even a drugged puppet

03:53.430 --> 03:54.780
is enough to corner me to this extent.

03:55.400 --> 03:56.820
If they form an army with these puppets,

03:57.280 --> 03:57.890
I'm sure Prince of Langya

03:58.310 --> 03:59.940
will be no match for Yong.

04:00.840 --> 04:02.010
It's just that this Night Crow is...

04:07.360 --> 04:08.540
Perfect.

04:10.360 --> 04:12.060
What a shame.

04:13.120 --> 04:14.660
Ms. Night Crow, what are you lamenting about?

04:15.470 --> 04:17.140
It's a shame that I can never create

04:17.870 --> 04:19.700
another perfect drugged puppet like him.

04:20.390 --> 04:21.050
The others

04:22.000 --> 04:22.850
are inferior to him.

04:26.600 --> 04:27.420
You'll find similar ones eventually.

04:27.950 --> 04:29.130
After all, there are plenty of good prospects left

04:29.480 --> 04:31.060
in Tianqi City.

04:33.480 --> 04:34.700
Tonight is a good night

04:35.390 --> 04:36.850
to reap some lives.

04:59.720 --> 05:00.290
Tu Wan!

05:00.800 --> 05:01.580
Just leave!

05:03.870 --> 05:04.490
Mr. Su,

05:05.190 --> 05:06.220
it hasn't even been

05:06.630 --> 05:07.780
15 minutes yet.

05:08.160 --> 05:09.460
You've done more than enough.

05:09.750 --> 05:10.490
If this continues,

05:10.950 --> 05:11.900
you'll die!

05:13.560 --> 05:14.580
It's been some time

05:14.600 --> 05:15.730
since I arrived at Tianqi City.

05:16.310 --> 05:17.490
I've heard of your name before.

05:18.000 --> 05:19.250
You're Second Master Tu of Thousand-Gold Tower.

05:20.040 --> 05:21.100
So, are the people of Thousand-Gold Tower

05:21.750 --> 05:23.220
also willing to risk their lives

05:23.390 --> 05:24.580
for their friends' sake?

05:31.390 --> 05:32.580
Who said I wouldn't risk my life for my friends

05:33.310 --> 05:34.930
just because I'm Second Master Tu?

05:36.680 --> 05:37.900
What if I'm Tu Wan, then?

05:38.950 --> 05:40.490
Can I sacrifice myself for my friends, then?

05:42.480 --> 05:43.930
When a man encounters a woman he fancies,

05:44.750 --> 05:46.370
and, he can't forget about her after their first encounter,

05:47.190 --> 05:48.460
we call that love at first sight.

05:49.270 --> 05:50.220
But for men,

05:50.800 --> 05:53.220
if we ever meet a man we can entrust ourselves to after our encounter,

05:54.160 --> 05:55.660
we call that an instant bond.

05:59.390 --> 06:00.610
Mr. Su and I

06:04.360 --> 06:06.210
had an instant bond.

06:06.240 --> 06:08.170
Excellent words.

06:32.070 --> 06:32.900
Mr. Su,

06:34.000 --> 06:34.930
I'm incompetent at martial arts.

06:36.120 --> 06:37.660
This is the furthest I can go.

06:55.120 --> 06:55.980
How could this be?

06:57.360 --> 06:58.610
It hasn't even been

06:59.510 --> 07:00.810
15 minutes yet.

07:01.480 --> 07:03.100
It's because I'm Su Muyu.

07:04.600 --> 07:06.020
I'm Su Muyu of Blood River.

07:06.430 --> 07:07.760
Therefore, I'm always

07:07.760 --> 07:09.410
stronger

07:09.600 --> 07:10.930
than what people think of me.

07:13.240 --> 07:14.050
Fine.

07:35.120 --> 07:36.610
Initially, I wanted to visit a pleasure house.

07:37.870 --> 07:38.730
But suddenly, I sensed

07:39.360 --> 07:41.020
a strong killing intent coming from here.

07:41.430 --> 07:42.900
Back then, I turned around and ran away.

07:44.190 --> 07:46.270
I ran across three streets in a row.

07:46.830 --> 07:47.970
In my mind, I was thinking

07:48.720 --> 07:49.700
that I should come and take a look.

07:51.750 --> 07:52.980
But in reality,

07:53.720 --> 07:55.100
I was still terrified.

07:58.160 --> 08:00.100
My fear suddenly went away

08:01.360 --> 08:02.810
when he unsheathed his sword.

08:05.800 --> 08:06.660
Perhaps I'll turn into someone

08:08.120 --> 08:09.730
like Big Brother in the future.

08:10.950 --> 08:11.780
Someone fat-headed and big-eared,

08:12.240 --> 08:13.140
sly and deceitful.

08:13.720 --> 08:14.460
But now,

08:15.870 --> 08:16.900
I'm still Tu Wan.

08:18.390 --> 08:19.730
I can sacrifice myself

08:20.680 --> 08:21.850
for my friends.

08:37.910 --> 08:38.490
Thank you so much.

08:41.360 --> 08:42.100
I'll surely remember

08:42.510 --> 08:43.770
your kindness today.

08:45.000 --> 08:46.300
I'll take Miss Bai and treat her condition first.

08:46.840 --> 08:47.820
I'll entrust this place to you.

08:49.000 --> 08:49.850
Go ahead. Don't worry.

09:02.440 --> 09:03.610
It seems this ancient manual

09:04.390 --> 09:06.310
is related

09:06.870 --> 09:08.010
to the puppet spell somehow.

09:09.720 --> 09:10.850
The puppet spell

09:11.630 --> 09:12.980
is now in the grasp of Medicine King Valley.

09:13.910 --> 09:16.010
If I can receive the help of Medicine King,

09:17.030 --> 09:19.940
perhaps I can catch a glimpse of its secrets.

09:22.870 --> 09:23.460
Come in.

09:25.440 --> 09:25.940
Ms. Yun.

09:29.390 --> 09:30.600
I instructed you to infiltrate the ranks of

09:31.270 --> 09:32.730
the deputy commander's Jinwu Guards.

09:33.600 --> 09:34.920
But now, you're paying me a visit.

09:35.440 --> 09:37.130
Has the deputy commander's son's illness

09:37.200 --> 09:38.370
shown signs of improvement?

09:38.670 --> 09:39.960
Second Master Tu of Thousand-Gold Tower

09:39.960 --> 09:40.850
brought a healer here.

09:41.840 --> 09:42.530
The deputy commander

09:42.630 --> 09:43.820
wanted her to stay.

09:44.750 --> 09:46.820
But one of their friends suddenly came here

09:47.000 --> 09:47.820
and took them away.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.060
What happened after that?

09:50.270 --> 09:51.770
What happened after they left

09:52.150 --> 09:52.940
the deputy commander's manor?

09:53.630 --> 09:55.180
After they left the deputy commander's manor,

09:55.480 --> 09:56.580
they encountered an assassin.

09:57.080 --> 09:57.940
Who was the assassin?

09:58.910 --> 10:00.340
The assassin wielded six blades.

10:01.720 --> 10:03.850
Was it Xu Liuyun, the Blade Ghost of Nanjue?

10:03.870 --> 10:04.340
Indeed.

10:05.150 --> 10:06.370
I didn't dare to get near them.

10:06.750 --> 10:07.820
I merely observed the encounter from afar.

10:08.480 --> 10:10.100
It seemed like the healer was injured.

10:10.670 --> 10:11.940
I think she was

10:12.750 --> 10:13.940
the assassin's true target

10:14.270 --> 10:14.940
from the start.

10:17.240 --> 10:19.300
So, his friend was able to kill the Blade Ghost.

10:20.910 --> 10:22.520
And, the healer was targeted by

10:22.520 --> 10:23.730
the Blade Ghost.

10:26.240 --> 10:27.180
You said Second Master Tu

10:27.200 --> 10:28.490
hired them to provide treatment, right?

10:29.510 --> 10:30.820
Which clinic do they come from?

10:31.320 --> 10:33.420
He-Yu Clinic of Mingcheng Alley.

10:35.240 --> 10:35.940
I understand now.

10:45.270 --> 10:45.940
I finished off

10:46.270 --> 10:46.980
your Wolf.

10:50.630 --> 10:51.700
How come your Tiger

10:51.720 --> 10:52.730
can finish off my Wolf?

10:53.670 --> 10:54.710
Isn't it common for tigers

10:55.080 --> 10:55.890
to prey on wolves?

10:57.120 --> 10:58.420
Wolves come in packs.

10:58.910 --> 11:00.300
Tigers are solitary beasts.

11:01.030 --> 11:02.770
As the saying goes, two fists cannot stand against four hands.

11:03.550 --> 11:04.060
Your tiger is alone.

11:04.320 --> 11:05.210
It's no match for my pack of wolves.

11:06.320 --> 11:07.770
Where's your pack of wolves, then?

11:13.840 --> 11:14.180
Over here.

11:14.270 --> 11:14.650
This...

11:14.960 --> 11:15.770
Are you sure about this?

11:17.080 --> 11:17.730
Can't I do so?

11:23.390 --> 11:24.060
I'm dead.

11:31.750 --> 11:33.130
Why isn't Master back yet?

11:34.000 --> 11:34.580
Don't worry.

11:34.960 --> 11:36.060
Master Su is there.

11:36.360 --> 11:38.010
Even if it's the deputy commander's manor,

11:38.240 --> 11:39.250
he can still enter and exit at will.

11:41.550 --> 11:42.100
Enough.

11:42.320 --> 11:43.490
If you're still worried about them,

11:44.080 --> 11:44.980
I'll perform divination for you.

11:45.870 --> 11:48.100
By divination, you meant tossing a coin.

11:48.120 --> 11:49.170
Is it even accurate?

11:49.630 --> 11:50.610
It had always worked.

11:56.120 --> 11:57.420
Su Muyu hasn't returned yet.

11:58.550 --> 11:59.820
Why aren't you panicking at all?

12:02.790 --> 12:04.960
I remember that someone was panicking

12:05.200 --> 12:05.910
when

12:06.200 --> 12:07.610
we were in Tianqi City.

12:09.200 --> 12:10.730
Times have changed.

12:11.240 --> 12:12.300
Yu is amazing.

12:13.080 --> 12:13.730
I don't think he needs

12:13.750 --> 12:15.130
a useless and harmless person like me to worry about him.

12:16.080 --> 12:16.770
I think

12:16.910 --> 12:18.370
we should be worried about

12:18.550 --> 12:19.850
the deputy commander instead.

12:21.150 --> 12:21.820
Wait.

12:23.390 --> 12:24.370
Was that another joke?

12:27.030 --> 12:28.100
What if

12:28.720 --> 12:29.940
I were there instead of Mr. Su?

12:31.120 --> 12:31.850
Would you worry about me?

12:36.790 --> 12:38.540
I mean,

12:40.440 --> 12:41.420
I'm the current head of the family.

12:45.480 --> 12:47.710
If only I could use my Poison-Sand Palm now.

12:47.790 --> 12:48.890
I would've killed you in an instant.

12:49.720 --> 12:50.370
You think

12:50.480 --> 12:51.610
you're a worthy head of family?

13:06.360 --> 13:06.980
This is bad.

13:22.630 --> 13:23.130
Master.

13:29.720 --> 13:31.060
Xu Liuyun is dead.

13:31.790 --> 13:32.420
How could that be?

13:33.080 --> 13:33.850
Isn't he the Blade Ghost?

13:34.360 --> 13:35.340
Even so, he's a human.

13:36.080 --> 13:37.250
He's not unkillable.

13:38.790 --> 13:39.930
General Dian,

13:40.360 --> 13:41.560
your uncle,

13:41.560 --> 13:43.160
hired him to assassinate the miracle physician

13:43.160 --> 13:44.290
of Medicine King Valley.

13:45.240 --> 13:46.490
He was inferior to Umbrella Ghost.

13:46.750 --> 13:47.770
He was killed off instead.

13:48.440 --> 13:49.100
I suppose

13:50.080 --> 13:52.610
he's panicking right now.

13:53.510 --> 13:55.010
He'll surely mobilize

13:55.150 --> 13:57.010
more of his hidden blades in the dark.

14:03.120 --> 14:03.890
I don't need to worry

14:05.030 --> 14:06.010
if it's Uncle we're talking about.

14:08.150 --> 14:08.940
Yong.

14:12.030 --> 14:13.260
Are you not worried

14:14.030 --> 14:15.420
due to the fact

14:15.670 --> 14:16.780
that he's your uncle?

14:17.910 --> 14:19.060
Or are you not worried

14:19.150 --> 14:21.810
due to his capabilities?

14:27.630 --> 14:28.500
Now,

14:28.550 --> 14:30.180
you're already better than me.

14:31.000 --> 14:32.380
You wish to get something done,

14:32.720 --> 14:34.810
but you don't want to dirty your hands.

14:35.360 --> 14:36.210
I suppose kinship

14:37.000 --> 14:39.900
is an excellent tool indeed.

14:44.150 --> 14:45.140
Let's see

14:46.080 --> 14:47.420
if Uncle can get things done

14:47.510 --> 14:48.500
in a beautiful manner.

14:49.000 --> 14:49.850
If not,

14:50.200 --> 14:51.900
we have no choice but to depend on Su Changhe.

14:52.440 --> 14:53.540
He's

14:54.240 --> 14:55.660
a double-edged sword.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.450
Her bleeding has been stopped.

15:06.200 --> 15:06.930
Yu,

15:07.150 --> 15:07.730
did you use

15:07.750 --> 15:08.970
the Unyielding Gold on Master?

15:10.150 --> 15:10.850
I think so.

15:11.510 --> 15:12.660
Miss Bai instructed me to do so.

15:13.630 --> 15:14.690
But she fainted

15:15.240 --> 15:16.330
before I managed to do it.

15:16.840 --> 15:17.610
You did great.

15:18.240 --> 15:19.380
Without it,

15:19.720 --> 15:20.380
I suppose

15:20.550 --> 15:21.810
no one could save her.

15:22.480 --> 15:23.810
Master was struck by blades.

15:23.870 --> 15:24.660
The blade qi

15:24.790 --> 15:25.730
is still within her body.

15:26.240 --> 15:27.900
We have to force it out of her.

15:28.720 --> 15:29.420
Head of Mu family.

15:29.910 --> 15:30.380
Yes.

15:30.750 --> 15:31.450
Listen to my command.

15:31.870 --> 15:32.540
When I give you the signal,

15:32.790 --> 15:33.610
strike Master's Baihui acupoint

15:33.720 --> 15:34.540
with your palm.

15:34.720 --> 15:35.660
Don't use too much force.

15:36.150 --> 15:37.780
Make sure it's gentle yet strong at the same time.

15:38.440 --> 15:39.060
If not,

15:39.150 --> 15:40.210
even if Master does survive,

15:40.440 --> 15:41.970
her skull will be dented.

15:42.200 --> 15:43.020
She'll be furious.

15:43.320 --> 15:43.810
I understand.

15:44.080 --> 15:44.850
This is my expertise.

15:52.240 --> 15:52.810
Zhaoyan,

15:53.240 --> 15:54.140
what do I need to do?

15:56.600 --> 15:57.210
Yu,

15:57.910 --> 15:59.140
you don't need to do anything for now.

15:59.510 --> 16:00.450
You were seriously wounded as well.

16:00.750 --> 16:02.260
You should rest and recuperate.

16:06.510 --> 16:07.180
Okay.

16:08.120 --> 16:09.020
Just focus on saving her.

16:09.390 --> 16:10.260
You may ignore me.

16:19.510 --> 16:20.140
Yu.

16:20.390 --> 16:21.060
What happened?

16:21.790 --> 16:22.900
When Miss Bai went out to give diagnoses,

16:23.240 --> 16:24.170
she realized

16:24.200 --> 16:26.210
that some noblemen were struck by the puppet poison.

16:26.600 --> 16:28.020
She was ambushed on her way back.

16:28.630 --> 16:29.500
She was seriously wounded.

16:30.150 --> 16:31.690
I failed to protect Miss Bai.

16:32.320 --> 16:33.140
Could the assailant be

16:34.440 --> 16:35.330
Xu Liuyun?

16:36.910 --> 16:37.610
How did you know?

16:38.120 --> 16:39.540
This morning, I received news

16:39.910 --> 16:41.730
that Xu Liuyun, the Blade Ghost, had entered Tianqi City.

16:41.960 --> 16:43.780
And, he even made contact with Flying Tiger General's Residence.

16:44.440 --> 16:45.180
I didn't expect him

16:45.720 --> 16:46.810
to act this quickly.

16:47.840 --> 16:48.570
Did he escape?

16:49.000 --> 16:49.850
He's already dead.

16:51.750 --> 16:53.020
The culprit was Flying Tiger General.

16:54.120 --> 16:56.090
It seems Changhe's initial speculation was spot-on.

16:56.390 --> 16:58.210
This was the work of Xiao Yong, the first prince.

16:58.630 --> 16:59.500
And, that Night Crow,

17:00.390 --> 17:02.730
it's likely that she's hiding in Flying Tiger General's Residence.

17:03.200 --> 17:04.780
We kept a close eye on their residence

17:05.110 --> 17:06.540
in order to track down Night Crow.

17:06.880 --> 17:07.460
However,

17:07.680 --> 17:08.850
they always tried to throw us off with tricks,

17:09.270 --> 17:11.130
causing us to expend a lot of energy to track them down.

17:11.550 --> 17:12.940
In the end, it was a ruse.

17:13.590 --> 17:14.540
It seems the Blade Ghost

17:15.270 --> 17:17.060
left the residence

17:17.240 --> 17:18.260
when we were tricked by the feint attack.

17:19.270 --> 17:20.330
I need to head there.

17:20.680 --> 17:21.300
Yu,

17:21.550 --> 17:22.300
have you lost your mind?

17:22.590 --> 17:23.330
Just ignore me.

17:23.790 --> 17:25.090
Keep guard over the place.

17:25.200 --> 17:25.890
Yu, you mustn't.

17:26.240 --> 17:27.300
Your current priority

17:27.310 --> 17:28.170
is to rest and recuperate.

17:28.590 --> 17:29.810
If you seek revenge

17:29.880 --> 17:30.740
in this state,

17:31.030 --> 17:32.260
you'll lose more than you'll gain.

17:32.400 --> 17:33.260
What do you think will happen next

17:33.960 --> 17:34.650
if I don't head there

17:34.680 --> 17:35.610
right now?

17:37.790 --> 17:39.500
Do you think He-Yu Clinic will still be safe?

17:40.750 --> 17:41.740
If I were them, and I found out

17:43.440 --> 17:45.220
that Miss Bai has figured out the secret behind the drugged puppets,

17:45.920 --> 17:47.060
I would get rid of her

17:47.400 --> 17:48.130
at all costs.

17:48.440 --> 17:49.540
Even if the Blade Ghost is dead,

17:50.920 --> 17:52.890
I'll send out the rest of my elite members

17:53.550 --> 17:54.460
to hunt her down.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.460
It seems a group of elites

17:58.070 --> 17:59.540
will gather at this clinic soon.

18:00.270 --> 18:00.890
Some of the arrays set up by

18:00.890 --> 18:02.260
Qingyang and I are still active.

18:02.880 --> 18:04.300
It shouldn't be that easy for outsiders to enter this place.

18:04.790 --> 18:06.500
What if we shift Miss Bai elsewhere?

18:07.110 --> 18:08.740
What if we shift her to the secret chamber where Changhe is meditating?

18:09.240 --> 18:10.370
Although I know nothing about medicine,

18:10.920 --> 18:12.570
there are similarities between the arts of poison and the arts of medicine.

18:13.070 --> 18:14.300
We can't afford to move her around now.

18:14.550 --> 18:16.060
If we do,

18:16.310 --> 18:17.370
her zhenqi will react wildly.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.370
And, she might die at any time.

18:23.070 --> 18:24.500
That's why I have to go.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.850
I have to show them

18:27.960 --> 18:29.090
my rage.

18:30.640 --> 18:31.300
I understand now.

18:32.240 --> 18:33.130
You're trying to tell them

18:33.680 --> 18:34.850
that Miss Bai is dead.

18:35.590 --> 18:36.890
That's why you're so enraged

18:37.160 --> 18:37.980
that you're forsaking your life.

18:40.480 --> 18:41.090
Fine.

18:41.310 --> 18:41.780
Yu,

18:41.790 --> 18:42.460
I'll join you.

18:42.720 --> 18:43.940
Stay here and protect everyone.

18:44.310 --> 18:44.850
But Yu...

18:44.880 --> 18:46.060
Changhe is still on a reclusive retreat.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.300
We have to depend on you.

18:51.550 --> 18:52.260
All right.

18:53.350 --> 18:54.500
Xuewei and I will remain here.

18:56.030 --> 18:56.810
Yu, you don't need to worry.

18:58.880 --> 18:59.780
Take care.

19:24.640 --> 19:25.370
They're here.

19:52.900 --> 19:54.260
[Tranquil Delight]

19:54.510 --> 19:55.220
All of you, stand back!

19:56.510 --> 19:57.170
Is this

19:58.030 --> 19:58.850
an array?

20:00.310 --> 20:01.410
Evil spirits.

20:02.000 --> 20:02.940
These are mere tricks.

20:04.070 --> 20:04.940
I'll dispel it.

20:30.070 --> 20:30.890
So, it's you.

20:32.830 --> 20:34.700
I did think about who my inner demon would be.

20:35.880 --> 20:38.090
It could've been Yi Bu, who dictated our lives for many years.

20:39.000 --> 20:40.700
Or my grandfather, who constantly lectured

20:41.030 --> 20:42.540
and disciplined me.

20:43.830 --> 20:45.020
Perhaps it could've been myself as well.

20:46.030 --> 20:47.020
But I never expected it

20:47.680 --> 20:48.540
to be you.

20:49.200 --> 20:50.300
Su Muyu,

20:51.110 --> 20:52.450
perhaps I envied your straightforward

20:52.480 --> 20:54.260
and carefree spirit all this while.

20:54.920 --> 20:55.810
But this time,

20:56.480 --> 20:57.980
as my inner demon,

20:58.070 --> 20:59.300
I get to face you again.

20:59.680 --> 21:00.610
This time,

21:01.880 --> 21:03.170
I won't back off.

21:14.590 --> 21:15.260
Qingyang and I

21:15.440 --> 21:17.300
had set up the Myriad Fantasy Array outside.

21:17.640 --> 21:18.940
Those who enter the array will be trapped there,

21:18.950 --> 21:20.060
and their inner demon will be shown.

21:20.440 --> 21:21.130
But I'll set up

21:21.510 --> 21:22.890
another poison array around the courtyard just in case.

21:23.160 --> 21:23.810
All right.

21:49.240 --> 21:51.220
We're reaching the crucial moment.

21:51.480 --> 21:53.020
We can't afford to let anyone interrupt the process.

21:53.310 --> 21:53.980
Understood.

21:54.790 --> 21:55.500
I'll make sure

21:55.750 --> 21:56.570
no one will interrupt us.

22:10.350 --> 22:10.940
Xuewei,

22:11.310 --> 22:12.850
your inner force is the gentlest among us.

22:13.110 --> 22:13.610
Head inside

22:13.680 --> 22:14.890
and expel the blade qi from Miss Bai's body.

22:15.270 --> 22:16.220
Yumo and I will keep guard here.

22:21.070 --> 22:21.570
All right.

22:29.000 --> 22:29.810
The array has been dispelled.

22:31.110 --> 22:31.810
Xie,

22:32.200 --> 22:33.130
you're extraordinary indeed.

22:34.160 --> 22:35.500
But there's one more poison array within.

22:36.030 --> 22:37.170
I do not excel at the arts of poison.

22:37.680 --> 22:39.810
Night Crow, please do something about it.

22:41.550 --> 22:43.780
An array within an array, huh?

22:44.750 --> 22:46.060
The poisonous miasma in the courtyard is pretty strong.

22:46.640 --> 22:47.740
We shouldn't let it go to waste.

22:48.550 --> 22:49.300
Go now.

23:02.830 --> 23:04.330
He's absorbing Xuewei's poisonous miasma.

23:11.000 --> 23:12.410
I don't care if you're his senior brother or not.

23:12.880 --> 23:14.460
If you dare to step into the house,

23:14.920 --> 23:15.980
I will kill you.

23:29.350 --> 23:30.090
So,

23:30.680 --> 23:31.650
this is the person

23:31.920 --> 23:33.220
who absorbed Xuewei's poison.

23:34.920 --> 23:36.740
Night Crow created this Gold-Body Puppet

23:37.070 --> 23:38.740
and made him absorb Xuewei's poison.

23:39.240 --> 23:40.740
He's Tang Lianyue's senior brother

23:41.000 --> 23:41.940
and the deputy sect leader of Tang Clan,

23:42.350 --> 23:43.170
Tang Linghuang.

23:43.590 --> 23:44.260
So,

23:45.070 --> 23:45.810
not only does he possess

23:45.920 --> 23:46.700
Xuewei's arts of poison,

23:47.240 --> 23:48.570
but he's also a Heaven-level master, huh?

23:49.440 --> 23:50.020
That's right.

23:50.790 --> 23:52.330
He's troublesome to deal with.

23:57.070 --> 23:57.780
General!

23:58.830 --> 23:59.460
General!

23:59.790 --> 24:00.410
General!

24:01.550 --> 24:02.130
This is bad!

24:02.240 --> 24:03.370
Someone has infiltrated our residence!

24:03.510 --> 24:04.020
Who?

24:04.030 --> 24:04.610
It's me!

24:22.830 --> 24:23.780
Su Muyu of Blood River,

24:24.110 --> 24:25.220
how dare you?

24:25.960 --> 24:26.740
What are you doing here?

24:27.310 --> 24:28.500
Blood River invited Miss Bai

24:28.590 --> 24:29.570
to Tianqi as our guest.

24:29.880 --> 24:31.260
To us,

24:32.160 --> 24:33.780
she's our dearest friend.

24:35.240 --> 24:36.410
I once told her

24:37.270 --> 24:38.220
that I would ensure her safety

24:39.270 --> 24:40.700
as long as I was around.

24:42.750 --> 24:44.220
But now, she's dead.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.650
She was killed by the assassin

24:46.720 --> 24:48.700
you hired.

24:50.680 --> 24:52.500
I want you to give me an account.

24:53.350 --> 24:55.300
Why should I?

24:55.640 --> 24:57.020
This is your choice.

24:58.720 --> 25:01.090
And I will make my choice now.

25:05.590 --> 25:07.260
Do you know what kind of offense it is

25:07.400 --> 25:09.260
to kill a general in Beili?

25:09.790 --> 25:10.570
You will die by a thousand cuts,

25:11.510 --> 25:12.540
and three generations of your kin will be executed.

25:13.400 --> 25:14.850
Three generations of my kin, huh?

25:23.830 --> 25:24.570
Su Muyu,

25:24.880 --> 25:25.780
you're seriously wounded.

25:26.350 --> 25:27.500
If you utilize your sword energy now,

25:27.510 --> 25:28.370
you'll die for sure.

25:28.790 --> 25:30.780
Even if you win, it'll be a Pyrrhic victory.

25:31.070 --> 25:32.170
You'd better think twice.

25:32.440 --> 25:33.410
Don't be reckless.

25:33.920 --> 25:35.130
Don't be reckless?

25:35.680 --> 25:37.890
This is the first time anyone has said that to me.

25:39.070 --> 25:40.170
But this time,

25:41.750 --> 25:43.130
I feel like being reckless!

26:07.310 --> 26:08.410
The poisonous miasma has been completely absorbed.

26:09.110 --> 26:10.060
Aren't you going to head inside?

26:11.070 --> 26:12.980
Let me try out the power of the enhanced drugged puppet.

26:15.750 --> 26:17.230
Su Muyu has infiltrated the general's residence.

26:17.270 --> 26:18.450
The situation is dire.

26:18.510 --> 26:19.060
Everyone,

26:19.270 --> 26:20.220
please head back immediately.

26:20.790 --> 26:22.260
Su Muyu isn't here?

26:22.880 --> 26:24.020
He went to the general's residence instead?

26:25.030 --> 26:25.570
But why?

26:25.790 --> 26:27.540
He said General killed the miracle physician.

26:27.750 --> 26:29.220
He went there to avenge her out of spite.

26:29.550 --> 26:31.250
But judging from his state,

26:31.250 --> 26:32.060
I suppose he has lost his mind.

26:32.380 --> 26:33.850
We've already dispatched the Jinwu Guards

26:33.960 --> 26:35.260
to the residence as reinforcements.

26:35.790 --> 26:37.020
Did he actually say

26:37.680 --> 26:39.170
that Bai Hehuai was dead?

26:39.240 --> 26:40.060
She's surely dead.

26:40.480 --> 26:41.460
Su Muyu was seriously wounded

26:41.480 --> 26:42.570
when he infiltrated the residence.

26:43.200 --> 26:43.740
However,

26:43.920 --> 26:45.300
from the way he was swinging his sword,

26:45.350 --> 26:46.890
I think he was trying to fight with reckless abandon.

26:47.400 --> 26:48.850
If you guys don't head there,

26:49.200 --> 26:49.780
I'm afraid

26:49.920 --> 26:51.260
he'll massacre the entire residence.

26:56.310 --> 26:56.980
Yu,

26:57.550 --> 26:58.500
could it be

26:58.790 --> 27:00.260
that we're going to die here?

27:01.680 --> 27:02.370
Let's head back!

27:11.590 --> 27:12.370
Stop!

27:20.720 --> 27:21.500
Fine, then.

27:33.550 --> 27:34.370
Who would've expected

27:35.310 --> 27:36.090
both of us

27:36.440 --> 27:38.460
to almost die from Xuewei's poison.

27:41.680 --> 27:42.540
It seems Yu

27:42.550 --> 27:43.610
created a commotion that was huge enough.

27:43.750 --> 27:44.890
That's why they were lured back.

27:45.110 --> 27:45.850
Are you guys okay?

27:52.880 --> 27:53.700
This poison is...

27:59.440 --> 28:00.260
Take this.

28:05.270 --> 28:05.810
Don't worry.

28:06.000 --> 28:06.540
I'll be fine.

28:06.750 --> 28:07.740
How's Miss Bai doing?

28:08.590 --> 28:09.410
Miss Bai is safe now.

28:10.310 --> 28:10.940
Great.

28:25.160 --> 28:26.220
I finally understand

28:27.160 --> 28:29.170
why Yi Bu and the rest

28:29.680 --> 28:30.700
would regard

28:31.270 --> 28:32.500
a martial arts organization this highly.

28:33.350 --> 28:34.500
One can catch a glimpse

28:34.790 --> 28:36.130
of Blood River's formidable power

28:36.880 --> 28:38.090
on Master Su alone.

28:39.960 --> 28:40.850
It makes those of us

28:41.240 --> 28:42.980
who barely survived the battlefield

28:44.680 --> 28:46.130
seem all the more insignificant.

28:46.830 --> 28:48.130
General, you once slew your enemies

28:48.310 --> 28:49.300
on the battlefield valiantly

28:49.510 --> 28:50.500
with your battle axes.

28:50.880 --> 28:52.700
But now, you're manipulating people

28:52.750 --> 28:54.300
and plotting sinister plots in Tianqi City.

28:54.790 --> 28:55.980
Do you even remember

28:56.070 --> 28:57.540
who you once were?

29:11.680 --> 29:12.500
Xie Zaiye.

29:13.070 --> 29:13.890
Master Su.

29:14.640 --> 29:16.170
You're truly disappointing.

29:17.400 --> 29:18.810
It seems Changhe was right back then.

29:19.550 --> 29:20.460
Sometimes,

29:21.030 --> 29:22.780
we should uproot everything

29:23.550 --> 29:24.650
without leaving a single one behind.

29:26.160 --> 29:26.890
I'm very impressed

29:26.920 --> 29:28.330
by the courage you and Patriarch possessed.

29:29.680 --> 29:30.500
I also regret the fact

29:31.030 --> 29:32.780
that I'm not as courageous or capable as you two.

29:33.920 --> 29:35.220
But this is my own choice.

29:51.750 --> 29:52.410
Indeed.

29:53.110 --> 29:55.060
It's because Changhe and I are strong enough.

29:55.310 --> 29:56.810
That's why we can

29:56.880 --> 29:58.700
get rid of the weeds

29:59.590 --> 30:01.300
that are growing again.

30:04.030 --> 30:04.890
It's been some time

30:05.030 --> 30:05.890
since our last battle.

30:06.310 --> 30:06.940
It seems

30:06.960 --> 30:08.540
your inner force has improved considerably.

30:09.350 --> 30:11.090
However, it's not as if my progress remained stagnant.

30:56.840 --> 30:58.060
Tang Linghuang.

30:58.310 --> 30:59.500
Your zhenqi is leaking everywhere,

31:00.030 --> 31:00.980
your sword aura is intact,

31:01.720 --> 31:03.130
and your killing intent has gotten stronger.

31:04.480 --> 31:05.540
Master Su,

31:05.830 --> 31:07.330
it seems you've gone demonic.

31:07.680 --> 31:08.890
Looks like my martial aunt

31:09.160 --> 31:10.980
is someone special to you.

31:11.680 --> 31:12.740
Night Crow.

31:14.110 --> 31:15.220
I will kill you.

31:20.160 --> 31:21.500
You think you can kill me in that state?

31:22.240 --> 31:24.330
You just took Tang Linghuang's attack head-on.

31:24.880 --> 31:26.650
Now, we don't need to do anything.

31:27.200 --> 31:29.130
You'll die from the poison

31:29.350 --> 31:31.020
within 7-8 minutes.

31:31.310 --> 31:32.940
But you're Su Muyu after all.

31:33.400 --> 31:35.810
You overthrew both Blood River and Shadow Sect.

31:36.590 --> 31:38.130
Who knows what will happen

31:38.680 --> 31:40.810
if we let you leave?

31:41.110 --> 31:41.890
So,

31:42.510 --> 31:43.940
it's time for you to die here.

32:02.590 --> 32:04.300
It's my first time seeing you in this state,

32:04.300 --> 32:05.130
young Muyu.

32:06.790 --> 32:07.460
Master.

32:08.110 --> 32:09.370
Where's young Changhe?

32:11.030 --> 32:12.090
If he sees you

32:12.310 --> 32:13.410
in this pathetic state,

32:14.030 --> 32:15.500
he'll surely mock you first.

32:16.440 --> 32:17.220
After that,

32:17.920 --> 32:20.300
he'll kill all of them.

32:20.830 --> 32:21.610
Who are you?

32:22.030 --> 32:23.330
Night Crow, the ghost physician.

32:24.350 --> 32:25.850
A traitor of Medicine King Valley.

32:26.680 --> 32:27.940
You were bold enough to turn

32:28.200 --> 32:30.300
the future leader of the Tang Clan into a drugged puppet.

32:31.030 --> 32:32.090
Now that you've offended them,

32:32.750 --> 32:34.740
you won't get away easily.

32:35.510 --> 32:36.460
Kill them!

32:45.000 --> 32:46.060
Hell Palm?

32:50.550 --> 32:51.130
Should we go after them?

32:51.350 --> 32:51.940
No need for that.

32:52.350 --> 32:53.370
Even if we do catch up to them,

32:54.000 --> 32:55.460
she'll kill all of you.

33:23.270 --> 33:24.370
Young Muyu, look at

33:24.480 --> 33:25.260
how pathetic you look.

33:38.160 --> 33:39.370
Fake diviner of the Mu family,

33:39.920 --> 33:40.740
since you're here,

33:41.240 --> 33:42.850
you should stop hiding.

33:43.270 --> 33:44.020
Who are you?

33:51.960 --> 33:52.740
You are...

33:53.880 --> 33:54.610
It's me.

33:55.240 --> 33:56.610
Long time no see, Mu Qingyang.

33:59.070 --> 34:00.090
Have you been to Mount Wangcheng

34:00.720 --> 34:02.610
and visited the sword deity you admired?

34:04.590 --> 34:05.700
Aren't you the owner of the library,

34:06.310 --> 34:07.130
Su Yunxiu?

34:07.180 --> 34:09.100
[Su Yunxiu, Blood River]

34:10.400 --> 34:11.500
I thought you were dead.

34:12.670 --> 34:14.090
I merely left Blood River.

34:14.920 --> 34:16.540
They couldn't track me down.

34:16.880 --> 34:18.340
They had no choice but to say that I was dead.

34:19.150 --> 34:20.460
I'm Su Yunxiu, you know?

34:21.550 --> 34:22.500
I taught

34:22.590 --> 34:24.650
both Su Muyu and Su Changhe.

34:25.320 --> 34:27.060
It's impossible for me to die that easily.

34:27.920 --> 34:29.380
Why do you still

34:30.440 --> 34:31.730
look the same?

34:32.320 --> 34:33.170
Yeah.

34:34.230 --> 34:35.570
I wonder

34:35.920 --> 34:37.460
why I still look the same.

34:41.150 --> 34:41.940
Su Muyu!

34:45.550 --> 34:46.250
You're here.

34:46.960 --> 34:47.860
How's Miss Bai?

34:49.480 --> 34:50.170
Miss Bai is fine.

34:50.440 --> 34:51.340
I'm here to fetch you back.

34:51.800 --> 34:52.500
This is great.

34:53.590 --> 34:54.420
Young Muyu,

34:55.800 --> 34:57.250
your teacher is still alive.

34:57.760 --> 34:59.460
I'm standing right in front of you.

35:00.320 --> 35:01.110
Why didn't you exhibit

35:01.110 --> 35:02.690
any signs of joy at all?

35:03.510 --> 35:04.900
Master, they said you were dead.

35:06.360 --> 35:07.860
Changhe and I investigated the area after that.

35:09.070 --> 35:10.420
We were 90% confident

35:11.320 --> 35:12.250
that you had escaped.

35:13.030 --> 35:14.130
What about the last 10%?

35:15.400 --> 35:16.460
For the last 10%,

35:17.760 --> 35:18.860
it was likely that you changed your identity

35:19.800 --> 35:21.570
and joined Blood River again.

35:24.280 --> 35:25.420
You do live up to your name as my disciple.

35:27.630 --> 35:28.570
But young Muyu,

35:29.360 --> 35:30.540
this is my first time seeing you

35:30.760 --> 35:31.650
this hot-headed.

35:32.590 --> 35:33.770
Why did you do so?

35:37.110 --> 35:37.900
A good friend of ours,

35:38.480 --> 35:39.900
the miracle physician, Bai Hehuai,

35:40.630 --> 35:41.860
was seriously wounded by our foes

35:42.070 --> 35:43.060
after she figured out their secrets.

35:43.510 --> 35:44.090
And,

35:44.320 --> 35:45.420
they wanted to silence her.

35:46.000 --> 35:47.170
Su Muyu was seriously wounded as well

35:47.840 --> 35:48.770
when he rescued her.

35:49.480 --> 35:50.170
And now,

35:50.590 --> 35:52.500
Miss Bai needs to rest and recuperate in a safe environment.

35:53.320 --> 35:54.250
Therefore, Su Muyu

35:54.550 --> 35:55.940
pretended that Miss Bai was dead

35:56.920 --> 35:57.730
and that he wanted to seek revenge.

35:58.760 --> 35:59.980
Only then would we be able to lure them away.

36:00.840 --> 36:02.420
He pretended to be enraged?

36:04.280 --> 36:05.860
To me, you were

36:06.360 --> 36:07.730
obviously enraged.

36:08.920 --> 36:10.020
Master, you're right.

36:11.320 --> 36:12.290
I wasn't pretending.

36:13.760 --> 36:14.540
That wasn't enough.

36:15.920 --> 36:16.980
Not yet.

36:17.840 --> 36:19.290
Was my rage not enough?

36:19.840 --> 36:20.540
No.

36:21.440 --> 36:23.060
The reason you gave us isn't convincing enough.

36:27.670 --> 36:28.500
You

36:29.590 --> 36:30.610
fancy her, don't you?

36:33.550 --> 36:34.170
Indeed.

36:35.320 --> 36:35.980
I fancy her.

36:40.880 --> 36:41.900
This is great.

36:44.230 --> 36:45.340
Why do you say so?

36:47.000 --> 36:48.290
It's because someone finally made

36:49.150 --> 36:51.340
Su Muyu fall in love.

36:52.150 --> 36:53.170
That's great.

36:54.110 --> 36:54.940
Su Muyu,

36:55.920 --> 36:57.820
I'm happy to see your current state.

36:58.710 --> 37:00.170
Although you're in a pathetic state now,

37:01.280 --> 37:02.380
this is

37:02.920 --> 37:03.940
the most handsome you

37:04.110 --> 37:05.420
I've ever seen.

37:08.230 --> 37:09.770
Do you know what an iceberg becomes

37:10.280 --> 37:11.460
when it melts?

37:12.230 --> 37:13.020
Master,

37:13.920 --> 37:14.820
please stop teasing me.

37:17.110 --> 37:19.130
It becomes the roaring ocean, silly boy.

37:23.710 --> 37:24.340
All right now.

37:24.800 --> 37:25.540
I'm going to leave.

37:26.960 --> 37:28.690
I was just passing by Tianqi City.

37:29.190 --> 37:29.820
I didn't expect

37:30.190 --> 37:32.420
to witness such an interesting turn of events.

37:35.070 --> 37:35.730
I know

37:36.510 --> 37:38.060
that you could've left the residence by yourself.

37:38.710 --> 37:40.020
You still have your trump card.

37:40.670 --> 37:41.540
But you and young Changhe

37:42.030 --> 37:43.020
are trying to create

37:43.320 --> 37:44.900
a new Blood River after all.

37:46.670 --> 37:48.020
If so, there's no room

37:49.000 --> 37:50.340
for any error.

38:08.840 --> 38:09.570
Su Muyu!

38:10.510 --> 38:11.170
Let's go.

39:13.590 --> 39:15.210
What exactly went wrong?

39:16.550 --> 39:18.980
Why can't I break my limit and reach the ninth level?

39:21.590 --> 39:22.250
What is it?

39:22.920 --> 39:23.500
Changhe,

39:23.920 --> 39:25.540
we received a message from Flying Tiger General's Residence.

39:25.800 --> 39:26.820
They asked you when you would finish your retreat.

39:33.670 --> 39:35.060
Why are they so impatient?

39:36.280 --> 39:38.250
I'll do it when the time is right.

39:43.760 --> 39:44.500
Last night,

39:44.800 --> 39:46.650
something happened at Flying Tiger General's Residence.

39:47.480 --> 39:48.130
What happened?

39:50.000 --> 39:50.860
Firstly, Miss Bai

39:50.920 --> 39:52.170
found out about their secrets.

39:52.550 --> 39:53.980
Due to that, she was seriously wounded.

39:54.320 --> 39:56.210
After that, in order to lure their foes away,

39:56.360 --> 39:57.860
Yu disregarded the wounds that he had sustained

39:58.150 --> 39:59.860
and attacked Flying Tiger General's Residence forcefully.

40:00.480 --> 40:01.560
Yu almost

40:01.560 --> 40:02.900
wiped all of them out.

40:03.960 --> 40:05.170
They only managed to drive back Yu

40:05.170 --> 40:06.250
after their reinforcements arrived.

40:07.150 --> 40:09.250
Now, both Yu and Miss Bai

40:09.280 --> 40:10.290
are seriously wounded.

40:10.880 --> 40:12.290
They're hiding

40:12.400 --> 40:13.690
in a remote house as we speak.

40:16.550 --> 40:18.340
Have Dian Ye and his men lost their minds?

40:20.400 --> 40:22.290
I said that I could help them.

40:22.960 --> 40:24.460
But under no circumstances

40:24.510 --> 40:25.610
are our Blood River members to be harmed.

40:28.030 --> 40:28.570
Changhe,

40:29.550 --> 40:31.380
why must we work with them?

40:31.960 --> 40:32.920
If we had stepped in

40:32.920 --> 40:33.940
in time last night,

40:34.230 --> 40:35.360
Yu might not

40:35.360 --> 40:36.570
